  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: afe46c950e4801d44beb311b827ea6c0, type: 3}
  m_Name: Dialogue_ZEVLab_phase3
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueData
  Style: 0
  Nodes:
  - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f339d0df707e4bdd9c7c5a0e8f9f2ca2, type: 2}
    Emotion: 1
    LocalizationKey: lab.zev.phase3.00
    DefaultText: "이제 마지막 조항입니다. 크게 받아칠 틈을 드리죠."
    EventTriggerID:
    IsChoiceNode: 0
    Choices: []
  - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2e43b565b4b937d42bd80c85eb983cae, type: 2}
    Emotion: 1
    LocalizationKey: lab.zev.phase3.01
    DefaultText: "계약서 끝에 제일 위험한 걸 쓰는 버릇 있으시죠?"
    EventTriggerID:
    IsChoiceNode: 0
    Choices: []
  - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f339d0df707e4bdd9c7c5a0e8f9f2ca2, type: 2}
    Emotion: 1
    LocalizationKey: lab.zev.phase3.02
    DefaultText: "자신이 없다면 피하셔도 됩니다. 무리한 방어는 금물입니다."
    EventTriggerID:
    IsChoiceNode: 0
    Choices: []
  - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2e43b565b4b937d42bd80c85eb983cae, type: 2}
    Emotion: 1
    LocalizationKey: lab.zev.phase3.03
    DefaultText: "이번에는 제가 앞으로 나가 볼게요."
    EventTriggerID:
    IsChoiceNode: 0
    Choices: []
